        {
            "id": 6670097,
            "title": "〈焦點股〉中興電在手訂單維持高檔 漲逾半根停板",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>中興電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1513:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1513\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1513-TW</a>)持續受惠台電強韌電網計畫，加上AI帶動科技廠擴廠需求，第三季稅後純益達12.91億元，每股純益2.61元，創單季歷史新高。中興電目前在手訂單達431億元，部分訂單能見度看至2030年，今年營運可望逐季升溫，激勵中興電今(23)日走揚，大漲逾半根停板。 </p></section><p><template id=\"P:1\"></template></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>中興電早盤以127.5元開平盤，盤中最高漲至136元，漲逾半根停板，截至午盤，股價暫報134元，漲幅約5.1%，成交量超過2000張。三大法人持續敲進中興電，連續6個交易日買超，合計買超1975張。 </p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>中興電第三季營收73.3億元，季減2.7%，年增7.94%；毛利率27.6%，季減0.84個百分點，年增1.73個百分點；營益率18.58%，季減0.53個百分點，年增1.82個百分點；稅後純益12.91億元，季增1.82%，年增13.4%，每股純益2.61元。 </p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>中興電累計今年前三季營收213.53億元，年增4.97%；毛利率27.4%，年增2.09個百分點；營益率19.09%，年增0.77個百分點；稅後純益35.15億元，年增18.8%，每股純益7.11元。 </p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>重電族群今天皆有所表態，亞力(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1514:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1514\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1514-TW</a>)，士電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1503:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1503\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1503-TW</a>)漲逾2%，華城(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1519:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1519\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1519-TW</a>)則漲逾1%。 </p></section></main>",
